WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Speaker>So, um, good morning everyone and thank you for coming.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Speaker>I want to talk about, uh, how small teams ship reliable data.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.000
<v Speaker>It's kind of a story about three mistakes we made.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
<v Speaker>The first one, you know, was trusting a single nightly job.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
<v Speaker>So let me show you what that looked like in practice.
